Package: lbs
Title: Personal R Toolkit for Data Archival and Stata-Style Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9071
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Wei",
           family = "Luo",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "liu.bian.shi@gmail.com")
Description: A personal collection of R helpers covering Parquet-based data
    archival with metadata indexing, Stata-style data inspection
    (stdes/stsum/stxtset), panel/time-series helpers, propensity score
    matching, event-study DID utilities, ggplot2 theme/plot helpers, and a
    config-driven task runner that integrates with the go-task CLI.
